1
00:00:00,364 --> 00:00:04,494
(Leonard:)I bet I could throw a rock in this room
and come up with three better friends.

2
00:00:12,251 --> 00:00:14,331
(Raj:)Holy crap.

3
00:00:18,549 --> 00:00:21,889
(Raj:)It's like Silence of the Lambs
down here.

4
00:00:22,928 --> 00:00:23,968
[SQUEALS]

5
00:00:26,807 --> 00:00:28,227
(Raj:)Don't do that.

6
00:00:29,268 --> 00:00:31,308
Don't be such a girl. They're just bugs.

7
00:00:31,478 --> 00:00:33,818
(Raj:)I don't like bugs, okay?
They freak me out.

8
00:00:33,981 --> 00:00:35,111
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

9
00:00:35,274 --> 00:00:37,604
(Sheldon:)You're afraid of insects and women.

10
00:00:37,776 --> 00:00:41,116
(Sheldon:)Ladybugs must render you catatonic.

11
00:00:43,156 --> 00:00:45,326
(Sheldon:)It was a joke.

12
00:00:45,826 --> 00:00:48,206
(Sheldon:)I made it to lessen your discomfort.

13
00:00:49,371 --> 00:00:50,831
(Sheldon:)You're welcome.

14
00:00:51,748 --> 00:00:53,208
[DOOR OPENS]

15
00:00:56,086 --> 00:00:58,426
Ha-ha. Don't knock. Just walk in.

